    },
    {
      "id": "tang-406",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "子夜吴歌",
      "subtitle": "冬歌",
      "author": "李白",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "明朝驿使发，一夜絮征袍。\n素手抽针冷，那堪把剪刀。\n裁缝寄远道，几日到临洮。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "d83008ded7a11fd9ba7b24ca985330e3bbb1338da14cdfb236e8cc2079a969f6",
